Package: frp-ssh-guard
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: FRP SSH Guard contributors <frp-ssh-guard@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: bash (>= 4.4), nftables (>= 1.0.6), python3 (>= 3.9), jq, iproute2, systemd, util-linux, coreutils, grep, sed, gawk | mawk
Recommends: logrotate
Description: Host-side connection guard for FRP-forwarded SSH ports
 Limits TCP connection attempts on selected frps listener ports using
 nftables, with manual allow/block lists, optional local SSH login learning,
 ban history, and repeat-offender escalation. Configuration is required
 before activation; installing this package does not alter firewall rules.
